00:20:44.042 --> 00:20:48.104
You know... I think it'd be great
if you three could always get along...

00:20:48.180 --> 00:20:50.444
...and work as a team.

00:20:52.184 --> 00:20:54.983
Like when you fought Ponta!

00:20:55.387 --> 00:20:58.049
Yeah! I'll get along!

00:20:58.123 --> 00:21:00.615
If you say so, Master Otaru...

00:21:00.692 --> 00:21:02.217
Great!

00:21:02.294 --> 00:21:04.262
You too, Bloodberry!

00:21:05.163 --> 00:21:07.530
| won't make that mistake again.

00:21:08.367 --> 00:21:11.530
Otaru, now I know what to do!

00:21:12.371 --> 00:21:13.532
Bloodberry...!

00:21:13.605 --> 00:21:15.266
Next time I'll feed
you the blue one!

00:21:15.340 --> 00:21:17.001
Because the red one
is as hot as hell"

00:21:21.413 --> 00:21:22.539
Otaru!

00:21:22.614 --> 00:21:24.514
Master Otaru!!

00:21:44.936 --> 00:21:48.497
When you're sad, when you're blue...

00:21:48.707 --> 00:21:52.405
...don't go off to be alone.

00:21:52.544 --> 00:21:55.377
Just think of me...

00:21:55.580 --> 00:22:00.074
...and I'll be there with you.

00:22:00.352 --> 00:22:04.084
Strength is a very important thing...

00:22:04.156 --> 00:22:07.820
...but tears are important, too.

00:22:07.993 --> 00:22:11.725
You can't do anything at all...

00:22:11.797 --> 00:22:13.492
...with a dried-up heart.

00:22:13.565 --> 00:22:17.559
You can't feel a thing.

00:22:19.671 --> 00:22:22.038
Tell me, why do people hide...

00:22:22.107 --> 00:22:27.045
...what they really feel inside?

00:22:27.212 --> 00:22:30.842
Take what you can do,
what you want to do...

00:22:31.049 --> 00:22:34.679
...one step at a time.

00:22:34.886 --> 00:22:38.584
I love the way you don't care...

00:22:38.657 --> 00:22:42.389
...how you have been
programmed to live.

00:22:42.527 --> 00:22:46.088
| would follow you anywhere.

00:22:46.465 --> 00:22:52.427
I'll never, ever let you go.

00:23:03.048 --> 00:23:04.379
Yoo-hoo! It's me, Lime!

00:23:04.449 --> 00:23:07.475
Tell me, tell me, Otaru!
Are we poor? Okay, then...

00:23:07.552 --> 00:23:11.614
...let's go buy those "lottery tickets"
things that will make us rich if we win!

00:23:11.690 --> 00:23:17.288
EEK!"! We won one of the prizes,
but the ticket disappeared!!

00:23:17.362 --> 00:23:18.989
Do you think Hannie took it??

00:23:19.364 --> 00:23:24.045
Getting Rich Quick is a Sour Joy
Next on Saber Marionette J!

00:23:24.069 --> 00:23:26.381
Getting Rich Quick is a Sour Joy
I love you, Otaru!

00:23:26.405 --> 00:23:27.839
